Seika_Tidewatch_House1_Text_Npc0::
	.string "My husband mends nets, I sell the\n"
	.string "fish. Fifty years now!\p"
	.string "The sea gives, and the sea takes.\n"
	.string "Mostly it gives.$"
	.string "{JPN}{JPN}じいさんが　あみを　なおし　わたしが　さかなを\n"
	.string "うる。　もう　50ねんじゃ！\p"
	.string "うみは　あたえ　うみは　うばう。　でも\n"
	.string "たいていは　あたえて　くれるのじゃ。$"

Seika_Tidewatch_House1_EventScript_Npc1::
	msgbox Seika_Tidewatch_House1_Text_Npc1, MSGBOX_NPC
	end

Seika_Tidewatch_House1_Text_Npc1::
	.string "A fine woman in a coat came\n"
	.string "through on a fast boat.\p"
	.string "She asked about the old road to\n"
	.string "MT. SKYREACH. I told her nothing!$"
	.string "{JPN}{JPN}りっぱな　コートの　おんなの　ひとが　はやい\n"
	.string "ふねで　やって　きたんだ。\p"
	.string "ソラトドキやまへの　ふるい　みちを　きかれたけど\n"
	.string "なにも　おしえなかったぞ！$"
